@HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Health check
GET {{HostAddress}}/health
Accept: text/plain

### Отримати всі курси
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/courses
Accept: application/json

### Отримати курс за ID
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/courses/1
Accept: application/json

### Створити новий курс
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Entity Framework Core",
  "description": "Advanced ORM",
  "teacherId": 1
}

### Оновити курс
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/courses/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Title",
  "description": "Updated description"
}

### Видалити курс
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/courses/1